# FS-CCE-387 omission DisclosureBearerQualificationScope
:expect-pins 2

# Missing DisclosureBearerQualificationScope withholds every disclosure consequence, including alternate action.
? obliged(OblSpecialOmit387DisclosureBearerQualificationScopeDisclosureBearer, OblSpecialOmit387DisclosureBearerQualificationScopeDisclosureDuty, OblSpecialOmit387DisclosureBearerQualificationScopeDisclosureStandard).
# => FALSE

# Missing DisclosureBearerQualificationScope withholds every disclosure consequence, including alternate action.
? obliged(OblSpecialOmit387DisclosureBearerQualificationScopeDisclosureReader, ReadAndActOnProportionateDisclosure, OblSpecialOmit387DisclosureBearerQualificationScopeDisclosureStandard).
# => FALSE
